id: pm-22rzjp
title: Restore strict unknown-key parity for docs linked-artifact additions
description: "GH-1000 reproduces a regression against closed pm-0v9k: files --add rejects an unrecognized left-hand key while docs --add accepts the same malformed key=value shape as a literal path. Restore the shared SDK parser boundary without removing intentional bare values, and prove parity across CLI and SDK transports."
